[{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0200","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0200.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-10271","title":"Oracle WebLogic Server XMLDecoder 反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"tags.\n\nLet me write a proper Chinese description:\n\nOracle WebLogic Server 的 WLS Security 组件中存在 XMLDecoder 反序列化漏洞。受影响版本包括 10.3.6.0.0、12.1.3.0.0、12.2.1.1.0 和 12.2.1.2.0。攻击者无需身份认证，即可通过网络发送特制的 T3 协议数据包触发反序列化，导致远程代码执行并完全接管 WebLogic Server。该漏洞利用条件简单（网络访问、无需认证、无需用户交互），CVSS 3.1 评分 7.5（HIGH），危害严重。\n\nThis is in Chinese, covers all required points, and is well over 50 characters.<value>Oracle WebLogic Server 的 WLS Security 组件中存在 XMLDecoder 反序列化漏洞。受影响版本包括 10.3.6.0.0、12.1.3.0.0、12.2.1.1.0 和 12.2.1.2.0。攻击者无需身份认证，即可通过网络发送特制的 T3 协议数据包触发反序列化，导致远程代码执行并完全接管 WebLogic Server。该漏洞利用条件简单（网络访问、无需认证、无需用户交互），CVSS 3.1 评分 7.5（HIGH），危害严重。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-10271"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-10-19T17:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:00:00Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Oracle WebLogic Server 10.3.6.0.6 或更晚版本、12.1.3.0.0 的修补补丁、12.2.1.1.0 的修补补丁以及 12.2.1.2.0 的修补补丁。打补丁后请重新启动服务器以使修补生效。如无法立即打补丁，可在防火墙层面封禁 T3 协议端口以减少暴露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpuoct2017-3236626.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101304","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039608","https://github.com/c0mmand3rOpSec/CVE-2017-10271","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43458/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43924/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-10271","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43458","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-10271.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-10271.md","https://github.com/xiaoZ-hc/redtool/blob/1cab56038526474ade99743f9f4d3e8db0396fb5/CVE_EXP/cve-2017-10271.py","https://github.com/qazbnm456/awesome-cve-poc/blob/fc862e38e03ea68cdc6261