7:41Z","remediation":"将 TYPO3 的 restler 扩展升级到 1.7.1 或更高版本（从 https://extensions.typo3.org/extension/download/restler/1.7.1/zip/ 下载）。如使用独立版 Luracast Restler，升级到 3.0.0 以上版本。若无法立即升级，删除或限制对 public/examples/resources/getsource.php 的访问权限，在 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）中添加规则阻止对该路径的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://extensions.typo3.org/extension/download/restler/1.7.1/zip/","https://extensions.typo3.org/extension/restler/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-15363.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-15363.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-15363.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e9d9f63ec95233a18ff0c401191fddd414b539a/cves/2017/15xxx/CVE-2017-15363.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/cve-2017-15363-2951.yaml","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-15363","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2017-15363_4.yaml","https://github.com/itsmenaga/Nuclei-Templates-All/blob/7e93c24e44969db15f4072e1c6a322a026452d6b/Vulnerability-Templates/cve-2017-15363-2948.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2017-15363-2950.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2017-15363_4_1.yaml","https://github.com/elijah-bennett0/IntentLimit/blob/bcfe225cf61ee454aa53896f7f3120246f52119f/tools/exploitation/CrazyIngrate/exploits/cve_2017_15363/cve_2017_15363.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0050.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0035","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0035.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-12629","title":"Apache Solr XML外部实体注入与远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apache Solr 7.1 之前版本中存在 XML 外部实体注入（XXE）与远程代码执行（RCE）漏洞。攻击者可通过向 Solr 服务发送带有 deftype=xmlparser 参数的特制 XML 查询请求，利用 XML 解析器对外部实体的处理缺陷，结合 Config API 的 add-listener 命令调用 RunExecutableListener 类实现远程代码执行。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击者可读取服务器任意本地文件（通过 ftp 包装器实现 Blind XXE）或执行任意系统命令，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。Apache Solr 7.1 版本已修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-12629"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-10-14T23:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:03:39Z","remediation":"立即升级 Apache Solr 至 7.1 及以上版本（Apache Lucene 同步升级至 7.1 及以上）。如无法升级，删除 RunExecutableListener 类的调用权限，禁用 XML 查询解析器（移除 deftype=xmlparser 支持），并在网络层面限制对 Solr Admin UI 和 /upload 接口的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://mail-archives.us.apache.org/mod_mbox/www-announce/201710.mbox/%3CCAOOKt51UO_6Vy%3Dj8W%3Dx1pMbLW9VJfZyFWz7pAnXJC_OAdSZubA%40mail.gmail.com%3E","http://openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2017/10/13/1","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101261","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:3123","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:3124","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:3244","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:3451","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:3452","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:0002","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:0003","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:0004","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:0005","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r140128dc6bb4f4e0b6a39e962c7ca25a8cbc8e48ed766176c931fccc%40%3Cusers.solr.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r26c996b068ef6c5e89aa59acb769025cfd343a08e63fbe9e7f3f720f%40%3Coak-issues.jackrabbit.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r3da74965aba2b5f5744b7289ad447306eeb2940c872801819faa