A8%E5%85%A5%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E-CVE-2017-12629.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/solr/CVE-2017-12629-RCE.md","https://github.com/Imanfeng/Apache-Solr-RCE","https://github.com/tdwyer/PoC_CVE-2017-3164_CVE-2017-1262","https://github.com/captain-woof/cve-2017-12629"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0035.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0300","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0300.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-11826","title":"Microsoft Office 内存破坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office 在处理内存中的对象时存在远程代码执行漏洞（CWE-119 内存破坏）。攻击者可通过构造特制的 Office 文档（如 Word 文件），诱使用户打开后触发内存损坏，从而在当前用户权限下执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Word 2007/2010/2013/2016、Office Web Apps Server 2010/2013、SharePoint Server 2010、Word Viewer 及 Office Online Server 等多个产品。攻击条件需要用户交互（打开恶意文档），已被发现在定向攻击中被利用。Microsoft 已于 2017 年 10 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-11826"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-10-13T13:29:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:02:26Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2017 年 10 月安全更新：Word 2007 安装 KB4011038，Word 2010 安装 KB4011238，Word 2013 安装 KB4011239，Word 2016 安装 KB4011240，Office Online Server 安装 KB4011260。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新。如无法立即打补丁，建议在邮件网关层面拦截包含恶意 RTF 附件的邮件，并禁用用户在 Office 中从远程位置嵌入 OLE 对象的功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101219","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039541","https://0patch.blogspot.com/2017/11/0patching-pretty-nasty-microsoft-word.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2017-11826","https://securingtomorrow.mcafee.com/mcafee-labs/analyzing-microsoft-office-zero-day-exploit-cve-2017-11826-memory-corruption-vulnerability/","https://www.tarlogic.com/en/blog/exploiting-word-cve-2017-11826/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cv