:"Microsoft Outlook 存在安全功能绕过漏洞，由于 Outlook 对内存中对象的处理方式存在缺陷，攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制的邮件或诱导用户打开恶意附件，利用 Outlook 对象模型（Object Model）绕过安全机制并执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Outlook 2010 SP2、Outlook 2013 SP1/RT SP1 及 Outlook 2016 版本，已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），实际攻击中常被用于初始访问和权限提升。攻击需要用户交互（如点击邮件中的恶意链接或打开附件），CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-11774"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-10-13T13:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:02:20Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2017 年 9 月安全更新：Outlook 2016 安装 KB4011038，Outlook 2013 安装 KB4011039，Outlook 2010 安装 KB4011040。如无法立即打补丁，可通过组策略或注册表禁用 Outlook 主页功能：在 HKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Software\\Microsoft\\Office\\<版本>\\Outlook\\WebView 中将 DisableHomePage 设为 1，或通过组策略「关闭 Outlook 主页」启用此设置，阻止攻击者利用邮件预览触发任意命令执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101098","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039542","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2017-11774","https://sensepost.com/blog/2017/outlook-home-page-another-ruler-vector/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-11774","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2017/CVE-2017-11774.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f015220eb1b2405b0fcce99fab82aef08d37a0ce/2017/CVE-2017-11774.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/8cdce133e25011854707bbda081d1789042b34cd/2017/CVE-2017-11774/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-11774.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-11774.json","https://github.com/keydet89/RegRipper3.0/blob/ec96dd4a6a5c3ea70d8fece9b47a374f83582335/plugins/outlook_homepage.pl","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/2017/database/CVE-2017-11774/SniperRoost-devcoinfet.md","https://github.com/frknaykc/Dragon-ThreatResearchHQ/blob/60fee7342ce45714e093570c2b43b364e1deecb8/feeds/cves.txt","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2017/CVE-2017-11774.md","https://github.com/3xpl01tc0d3r/Abusing-Outlook/blob/dfd080838ef4ac8078ea5ae5185f090856f05288/Commands.txt","https://github.com/devcoinfet/SniperRoost"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0222.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0222.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0222.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0049","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0049.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-15287","title":"Dream Multimedia Dreambox WebControl 反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Dream Multimedia Dreambox 设备的 BouquetEditor WebPlugin 存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。攻击者可通过向 /file URI 的 file 参数或\"Name des Bouquets\"字段注入恶意 JavaScript 代码，当管理员或用户访问特制链接时，脚本将在浏览器中执行，可能导致会话劫持、敏感信息窃取或页面篡改。该漏洞影响 Dreambox WebControl 2.0.0 版本，攻击者无需身份认证，仅需诱导用户点击恶意链接即可触发，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-15287"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-10-12T15:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:07:31Z","remediation":"厂商未发布针对此漏洞的官方补丁。建议采取以下措施：1）在 Dreambox 设备上禁用 BouquetEditor 插件，或通过 WebControl 管理界面关闭不必要的 Web 插件功能；2）对 /file URI 的 file 参数和 Bouquet 名称字段实施严格的输入过滤与输出编码，过滤 `<script>`、`<img>` 等 HTML 标签；3）通过防火墙限制 Dreambox Web 管理界面（默认 80/443 端口）仅允许可信内网 IP 访问，避免暴露在公网。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://fireshellsecurity.team/assets/pdf/Vulnerability-XSS-Dreambox.pdf","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42986/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42986","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-15287.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-15287.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-15287.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2017/CVE-2017-15287/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2017-15287.py","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2017-15287-2946.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/87c3c6939cf4753db954551441a9567082e88cc1/cves/2017/15xxx/CVE-2017-15287.json","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/8001-to-9000-templates/cve-2017-15287-2947.yaml","https://github.com/tholian-network/vulnerabilities/blob/cd8798a37e6d58633681c9596bee14e4189ad0e9/database/vulnerability/CVE-2017-15287.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2017-15287-2946.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2017-15287.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/cve-2017-15287-2946.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0049.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0111","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0111.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-1000253","title":"Linux Kernel 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ELF 二进制加载器（`load_elf_binary()`）在处理 PIE（位置无关可执行文件）时存在内存布局缺陷。当 `CONFIG_ARCH_BINFMT_ELF_RANDOMIZE_PIE` 启用且采用自上而下的地址分配策略时，加载器仅将第一个 PT_LOAD 段映射到 `mm->mmap_base` 下方，但未为整个二进制文件分配足够空间，导致后续 PT_LOAD 段被映射到本应属于栈与二进制之间\"间隙\"区域的上方，破坏了内核内存布局。本地低权限攻击者可通过构造特制的 SUID PIE 程序触发此漏洞，实现权限提升至 root。该漏洞影响未合入 2015 年 4 月补丁（commit a87938b2e246）的 Linux 长期支持内核版本，包括 CentOS 7 等发行版，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-1000253"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-10-05T01:29:04Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:58:59Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 3.10.77 及以上版本（或对应发行版已修复的内核包）。RHEL/CentOS 7 用户安装 kernel-3.10.0-514.32.3.el7 及以上版本，Debian 用户升级至 3.2.71-1（Wheezy）/ 3.16.7-ckt11-1（Jessie）/ 4.0.2-1（Sid）及以上版本。升级后须重启系统使新内核生效。如无法立即升级，可移除 SUID PIE 二进制文件的 SUID 位作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101010","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039434","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:2793","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:2794","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:2795","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:2796","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:2797","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:2798","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:2799","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:2800","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:2801","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:2802","https://www.qualys.com/2017/09/26/cve-2017-1000253/cve-2017-1000253.txt","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-1000253","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42887","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2017/CVE-2017-1000253.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f015220eb1b2405b0fcce99fab82aef08d37a0ce/2017/CVE-2017-1000253.json","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/a948a7d2229872f619772d074ca7ca9df53da527/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/Linux/Exploit/CVE-2017-1000253.yara","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/Linux/CVE-2017-1000253/Exploit_Linux_CVE-2017-1000253_G_MTB.yar","https://github.com/kaosagnt/ansible-everyday/blob/f3b6d25cad62fa07787f79cca168459ee4090ad4/bin/ansible_security-rhel-cve-2017-1000253","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-1000253","https://github.com/JlSakuya/Linux-Privilege-Escalation-Exploits/blob/4be1662ef925a0fe4e8b31393593a692c2fdc255/2017/CVE-2017-1000253/README.md","https://github.com/0xAX/asm/blob/13aee52310b14dd40aa05282dcb9c7015748be5d/content/asm_3.md","https://github.com/The-Z-Labs/linux-exploit-suggester/blob/937cf955501fe7da85994c98f0ca6151194e7c1d/linux-exploit-suggester.sh","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/79d573c4f91b29b559262b3c1cdb888df461c63f/2017/CVE-2017-1000253.json","https://github.com/RicterZ/PIE-Stack-Clash-CVE-2017-1000253","https://github.com/sxlmnwb/CVE-2017-1000253"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0111.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0308","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0308.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-12149","title":"Red Hat JBoss Application Server 反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"JBoss Application Server 5.x/6.x 中 HTTP Invoker 组件的 ReadOnlyAccessFilter 类的 doFilter 方法在反序列化操作时未对类进行限制，允许未经身份认证的远程攻击者通过向目标服务器的 HTTP 端口发送特制的序列化数据触发反序列化漏洞，进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Enterprise Application Platform 5.2 及多个 JBoss 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击无需任何权限和用户交互，利用门槛极低，已被广泛用于挖矿木马和勒索软件传播。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-12149"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-10-04T21:01:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:02:46Z","remediation":"升级 JBoss 至 5.2.0 及以上安全补丁版本，或迁移至 WildFly 以彻底修复反序列化缺陷。临时缓解措施：在反向代理或防火墙上限制对 /invoker/readonly 路径的外部访问，仅允许可信 IP 调用 HTTP Invoker 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/100591","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:1607","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:1608","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1486220","https://github.com/gottburgm/Exploits/tree/master/CVE-2017-12149","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-12149","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-12149.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-12149.md","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub/blob/946405b3447dbaf2a5eb49e2f56ec33fe1165e49/jboss/cve-2017-12149_poc.py","https://github.com/Mr-xn/Penetration_Testing_POC/blob/bc8c6ce29bd2d05ce5045727021202d1788770bf/vuln_pocs/exploit-tools/jboss_CVE-2017-12149/README.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/%E4%B8%AD%E9%97%B4%E4%BB%B6%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E/JBoss%205.x%206.x%20%E5%8F%8D%E5%BA%8F%E5%88%97%E5%8C%96%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20CVE-2017-12149.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2017/CVE-2017-12149/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2017-12149.py","https://github.com/fofapro/vulfocus/blob/4b7a2eaacce4ed770f289e6e72f7240da1e16c74/writeup/CVE-2017-12149/CVE-2017-12149.md","https://github.com/SkewwG/VulScan/blob/fc092dfe3b95299307404258c7d5a51d501bd5e2/Jboss/CVE-2017-12149_multi.py","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/50f657ad5d1fd5bd0d62718361ee31e898f44d48/data/2017/CVE-2017-12149-1337g_CVE-2017-12149.md","https://github.com/Coldwave96/PocLibrary/blob/4bdc069c257f441379e9fd428ac8df7d4f5e9ca9/Library/Jboss/cve-2017-12149_poc.txt","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/pocs_go/jboss/CVE_2017_12149.go","https://github.com/yunxu1/jboss-_CVE-2017-12149","https://github.com/sevck/CVE-2017-12149","https://github.com/1337g/CVE-2017-12149","https://github.com/jreppiks/CVE-2017-12149","https://github.com/JesseClarkND/CVE-2017-12149"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0308.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0308.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0308.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0508","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0508.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-12617","title":"Apache Tomcat PUT文件上传远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apache Tomcat 在启用了 HTTP PUT 方法（即将 Default Servlet 的 readonly 初始化参数设置为 false）时存在文件上传漏洞。远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP PUT 请求，向服务器上传包含恶意 JSP 代码的文件，随后通过访问该 JSP 文件触发服务器端执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Tomcat 7.0.0 至 7.0.81、8.0.0.RC1 至 8.0.46、8.5.0 至 8.5.22 以及 9.0.0.M1 至 9.0.0 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 8.1，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞，但需要目标服务器开启 PUT 方法且存在可写目录。目前已公开多个 PoC 利用脚本，实际威胁较高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-12617"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-10-04T01:29:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:03:38Z","remediation":"升级 Apache Tomcat 至 9.0.1、8.5.23、8.0.47 或 7.0.82 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，将 DefaultServlet 的 readonly 初始化参数设为 true（默认即为 true，确认未被显式改为 false），以禁用 HTTP PUT 方法上传文件功能。同时建议在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面拦截对 `.jsp` 后缀的 PUT 请求作为纵深防御。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpuapr2018-3678067.html","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpujan2018-3236628.html","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpujul2018-4258247.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/100954","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039552","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:3080","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:3081","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:3113","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:3114","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:0268","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:0269","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:0270","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:0271","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:0275","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:0465","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:0466","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:2939","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/1dd0a59c1295cc08ce4c9e7edae5ad2268acc9ba55adcefa0532e5ba%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/343558d982879bf88ec20dbf707f8c11