0064566bc111958a9e5cbb3b61cdc17/tomcat-cve-2017-12617.py","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-12617","https://github.com/cyberheartmi9/CVE-2017-12617","https://github.com/zi0Black/POC-CVE-2017-12615-or-CVE-2017-12717","https://github.com/LongWayHomie/CVE-2017-12617","https://github.com/ygouzerh/CVE-2017-12617","https://github.com/jptr218/tc_hack"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0508.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0508.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0508.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0121","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0121.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-6090","title":"PhpCollab PhpCollab 2.5.1 任意文件上传漏洞","description":"PhpCollab 是一个广泛应用于东东南亚地区的免费开源协同管理系统，在 2.5.1 及更早版本中存在严重的文件上传漏洞。攻击者只需在系统中拥有认证用户权限，即可通过 clients/editclient.php 文件上传带有可执行扩展名的恶意文件到 logos_clients 目录中，并通过直接请求这些文件来获取执行权限，从而实现在目标服务器上的任意代码执行。攻击者可以控制任意文件上传路径和文件名，绕过系统验证机制上传 Webshell 文件，并通过 Web 服务器直接访问这些恶意文件，从根本上破坏系统的安全运行。该漏洞影响 PhpCollab 2.5.1 及所有更早版本的用户，攻击者无需特殊权限，只需常规认证即可触发漏洞，CVSS 评分高达 8.8，严重威胁系统安全。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-6090"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-10-03T01:29:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:21:46Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 PhpCollab 至 2.5.2 或更高版本；若无法升级，请在 Web 服务器配置中禁止 logos_clients/ 目录执行 PHP 脚本（Apache 用 .htaccess 添加 php_flag engine off，Nginx 用 location ~ \\.php$ { deny all; }），同时在 editclient.php 上传逻辑中严格限制允许上传的文件扩展名（仅允许 jpg/png/gif）并校验 MIME 类型，必要时在 WAF 层面拦截带可执行后缀的上传请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://sysdream.com/news/lab/2017-09-29-cve-2017-6090-phpcollab-2-5-1-arbitrary-file-upload-unauthenticated/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42934/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43519/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42934","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-6090.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-6090.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/e6e8b9ac06818dca482495dce43afc9e74dfd4e2/2017/CVE-2017-6090.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/c9097bc88f77c877a08830c8bb997e760d5172eb/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-6090.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2017-6090.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-6090-3046.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-6090-3044.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-6090-3043.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2017/CVE-2017-6090/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2017-6090.py","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/cves/2017/CVE-2017-6090.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/phpCollab/CVE-2017-6090.yaml","https://github.com/jlk/exploit-CVE-2017-6090"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0121.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0121.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0121.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0048","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0048.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-14942","title":"Intelbras WRN 150 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Intelbras WRN 150 无线路由器存在认证绕过漏洞（CWE-552），远程攻击者无需任何身份验证，通过向 /cgi-bin/DownloadCfg/RouterCfm.cfg 发送直接 HTTP 请求并携带 admin:language=pt Cookie，即可读取设备完整配置文件，泄露管理员密码、网络设置等敏感信息，进而完全绕过路由器认证机制获得管理权限。攻击者可利用泄露的凭据修改 DNS 配置、劫持网络流量或实施中间人攻击，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-14942"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-09-30T01:29:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:07:01Z","remediation":"立即登录路由器管理后台检查固件版本，访问 Intelbras 官方支持页面下载并安装 WRN 150 最新固件。如厂商已停止支持，应在防火墙层面限制仅可信内网 IP 可访问路由器管理端口（80/443），并在 WAN 侧禁用远程管理功能，同时修改默认管理员密码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://whiteboyz.xyz/authentication-bypass-intelbras-wrn-150.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42916/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14942.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-14942.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14942.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1842f861696b8e0d2a79b27d77e1bfea36333d86/cves/2017/14xxx/CVE-2017-14942.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-14942","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-14942.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-14942.yaml","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2017/CVE-2017-14942.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2017/CVE-2017-14942.json","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14942.yaml","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2020-35391.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0048.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0048.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0048.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0409","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0409.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-12240","title":"Cisco IOS和IOS XE Software DHCP中继子系统缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 12.2 至 15.6 版本及 IOS XE 软件的 DHCP 中继子系统存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响设备发送特制的 DHCPv4 数据包触发该漏洞，成功利用可在目标系统上执行任意代码并获得完全控制权，或导致系统重载引发拒绝服务。该漏洞源于 DHCP 中继子系统对 DHCPv4 报文处理时边界检查不严导致的缓冲区溢出。Cisco 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，受影响用户应尽快升级至修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-12240"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-09-29T01:34:49Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:02:57Z","remediation":"立即升级受影响的 Cisco IOS 至 15.7(3)M 或更新版本，Cisco IOS XE 升级至 16.3.1 或更新版本。可通过 Cisco IOS Software Checker 工具查询具体修复版本号。如无法立即升级，建议在设备上移除 DHCP relay 配置（no ip helper-address），或配置 ACL 限制 DHCPv4 报文仅来自可信源。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录，需优先处置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101034","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039445","https://quickview.cloudapps.cisco.com/quickview/bug/CSCsm45390","https://quickview.cloudapps.cisco.com/quickview/bug/CSCuw77959","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20170927-dhcp","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-12240","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-12240.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2017/12xxx/CVE-2017-12240.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-12240","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2017/CVE-2017-12240/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-12240.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/SSVC/data/2017/CVE-2017-12240.json","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2017.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-q8rh-r33q-hvj2/GHSA-q8rh-r33q-hvj2.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2017/CVE-2017-12240.md","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/61a029b6511620ca4b0f0144ecf0f6b5056f65f9/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0409.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0409.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0408","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0408.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-12237","title":"思科 IOS/IOS XE IKEv2 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 和 IOS XE 软件的 Internet 密钥交换版本 2（IKEv2）模块存在拒绝服务漏洞。该漏洞源于受影响设备在处理特定 IKEv2 数据包时存在缺陷，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 IKEv2 数据包触发此漏洞，导致设备 CPU 利用率飙升、产生回溯消息甚至设备重载，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Cisco IOS 15.0 至 15.6 及 IOS XE 3.5 至 16.5 版本，设备无需配置任何 IKEv2 特定功能，只要启用 ISAKMP 即受影响，广泛涉及 LAN-to-LAN VPN、远程访问 VPN、DMVPN 及 FlexVPN 等多种 VPN 场景。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-12237"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-09-29T01:34:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:02:56Z","remediation":"立即升级到受支持版本 Cisco IOS 15.7(2)M5 或 Cisco IOS XE 16.6.1 或更高版本，这些版本包含了对 CSCvc41277漏洞的修复。如无法立即升级，可通过配置限制 IKEv2 流量速率（每秒不超过100个交易单元）并在防火墙上弃用不安全的IKEv2 Cryptographic Algorithms以作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101037","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039460","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20170927-ike","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-12237","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-12237.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2017/12xxx/CVE-2017-12237.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-12237","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1dac7e3201a376abf5c74e8edebb6384afa032f/2017/12xxx/CVE-2017-12237.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-12237.txt","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2017.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-pcwh-xxqr-qw2j/GHSA-pcwh-xxqr-qw2j.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2017/CVE-2017-12237.md","https://github.com/UWillC/netdevops-micro-tools/blob/f48ba521c0ebeecb2d2781b20e11cf059f66107c/cve_data/ios_xe/cve-2017-12237.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0408.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0406","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0406.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-12235","title":"Cisco IOS PROFINET DCP 报文解析拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 软件中 PROFINET 发现与配置协议（PN-DCP）的实现存在输入验证不当漏洞。该漏洞源于设备对入站 PN-DCP Identify Request 数据包解析不充分，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 PN-DCP Identify Request 数据包，并持续发送正常 PN-DCP Identify Request 数据包，触发设备重新加载，导致拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞影响 Cisco IOS 12.2 至 15.6 版本，自 IOS 12.2(52)SE 起 PROFINET 在基础交换模块和扩展单元以太网端口上默认启用，扩大了攻击面。攻击无需用户交互，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。Cisco 已发布安全公告修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-12235"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-09-29T01:34:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:02:56Z","remediation":"立即升级 Cisco IOS 至修复版本。使用 Cisco IOS Software Checker（https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/selectIOSVersion.x）查询受影响版本对应的修复版本，将设备升级至该修复版本或更高版本。由于无任何变通方案，升级是唯一修复途径。升级前可通过 `show running-config | include profinet` 确认 PROFINET 是否启用，若输出 `no profinet` 则不受影响；也可通过 `show profinet status` 检查 PROFINET 状态。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），建议优先处理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101043","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039451","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20170927-profinet","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-12235","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-12235.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2017/12xxx/CVE-2017-12235.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-12235","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1dac7e3201a376abf5c74e8edebb6384afa032f/2017/12xxx/CVE-2017-12235.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-12235.txt","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2017.txt","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2017/CVE-2017-12235.csv","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-83w7-v79x-495q/GHSA-83w7-v79x-495q.json","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2017-12235.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0406.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0400","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0400.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-12234","title":"Cisco IOS Common Industrial Protocol CIP 数据包解析拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 软件 12.4 至 15.6 版本的通用工业协议（CIP）功能实现存在多个安全漏洞。该漏洞源于设备对特制 CIP 数据包的解析不当，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 CIP 数据包触发此漏洞，成功利用可导致设备重载，造成拒绝服务（DoS）条件。该漏洞影响大量 Cisco IOS 设备，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。目前 Cisco 已发布安全公告修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-12234"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-09-29T01:34:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:02:56Z","remediation":"立即登录 Cisco.com 使用 Cisco IOS Software Checker 工具查询当前 IOS 版本对应的修复版本，将设备升级至包含 CSCvc43709 修复的 Cisco IOS 版本（如 15.7+ 或对应 Train 的最新安全修复版）。由于该漏洞已在野被积极利用，升级前可在网络边界 ACL 中拒绝目的 UDP 端口 2222 和 44818 的入站流量作为临时缓解措施，但最终必须完成版本升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101038","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039459","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20170927-cip","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-12234","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-12234.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2017/12xxx/CVE-2017-12234.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-12234","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1dac7e3201a376abf5c74e8edebb6384afa032f/2017/12xxx/CVE-2017-12234.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b